%% HTTP prefix: /api/v1. API lane includes verified middleware and errorHandler.
%% Grouped read and validation calls short-circuit on error. No Repository layer is implied.
%% Concurrent class usage is separately read through GET /enrollments/my/quota, not a remaining-session counter.
sequenceDiagram
    actor A as Member
    participant UI as MyClassesPage / SchedulePage
    participant API as Express middleware / errorHandler
    participant C as enrollmentsController
    participant S as enrollmentsService
    participant DB as Prisma / PostgreSQL

    A->>UI: Open own booked classes and timetable
    UI->>API: GET /api/v1/enrollments/my
    activate API
    API->>API: authenticate, checkFacilityScope, authorize(MEMBER), validate request
    alt request guard rejects
        API-->>UI: 400 / 401 / 403 error
    else request accepted
        API->>C: getMyEnrollments(req, res, next)
        activate C
        C->>S: getMyEnrollments(userId, query)
        activate S
        S->>S: Keep memberId ownership predicate when removing facility scope for own timetable
        S->>DB: Find own member profile and read enrollment.count / findMany globally for that member
        activate DB
        DB-->>S: Requested records and validation context
        deactivate DB
        alt own member profile missing
            S-->>C: 404 Member profile not found
        else business conditions satisfied
            S-->>C: Own enrollments with real facility identity and pagination
        end
        deactivate S
        C-->>API: response or next(error)
        deactivate C
        API-->>UI: 200 result or mapped error
    end
    deactivate API
    UI-->>A: Show result or actionable error

%% Request validation schemas (see route evidence): EnrollmentQuerySchema
